{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1000_p", "source_sha256": "78013180c197e2ce664e3731cc875842903dfaf96df73d8ce5017c7c1e75fcec", "ja": "（そろそろ、次の定期公演の準備を進めないとな。\n真美の新曲が目玉になるはずだが……）", "zh": "（差不多该开始准备下一场定期公演了。\n真美的新歌应该会成为亮点，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "d23d392d185aa0f6abe161c46c5a4e43e0966dc269cf22fb6adf9a037307c5a2", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\n見て見て！　ウッフーン♪　……どう！？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n快看快看！嗯哼♪……怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b1c9431011d0c358802974ae1cfce5622a82fa7d0c7802dfd6f29642bb51afc0", "ja": "エレナ？　どうしたんだ、いきなり。", "zh": "艾莲娜？怎么了，突然这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "8e6cc247d3747c03f1526eab86b6d3e0b9e861339a99e2cd36db7e3416cfa42c", "ja": "あれっ！？　{$P$}、\nちっともドキドキしなかった？　おかしいナ～……。", "zh": "咦！？{$P$}，\n你一点都没有心跳加速吗？好奇怪哦～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "c67cd60da08140bf9913d6d7cb2dd364ec69eef9f550387d02d4b31d1f3eac0b", "ja": "んっふっふっふ～……ここは真美の出番だね！\n兄ちゃん、真美の必殺技を受けてみよ！", "zh": "嗯呵呵呵～……这里该真美出场了！\n哥哥，接招吧，真美的必杀技！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "a2935085e4910c8f0ec7c19cd21ed1fca18469cc7819497a47c5f963386f69b4", "ja": "食らえ、セクシー……ウィンク！　パチッ！　パチッ！", "zh": "接招吧，性感……wink！啪嗒！啪嗒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6c0f49f977a15150a54c268231634bf16a904c05222e550e99f0c5b1fd953d21", "ja": "口で言っちゃってるな……。\nふたりとも、新しい遊びか？", "zh": "都直接说出来了啊……\n你们两个，这是在玩什么新游戏吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "466f89af9c9453f7f429c3f84e6c32cd02c926d15ebde968387cd81a093871d1", "ja": "ひどいよ兄ちゃん！　真美たちは真剣なのに……\n兄ちゃんにとっては遊びだったんだ！", "zh": "太过分了，哥哥！明明真美她们是认真的……原来对哥哥来说，只是玩玩而已啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "bdba3211f5bc2213f3d833bcec0f2fdf666fbaf74ad99164a0abad4c17acb6fe", "ja": "突然ごめんなさいね、{$P$}。\n真美ちゃんに頼まれて、セクシーを教えていたの。", "zh": "突然这样真不好意思，{$P$}。真美拜托我教她怎么性感来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "8126d8e308baae17abe8c5c582762d455447331fedf6f0900dc55ed8c5ae2c79", "ja": "実践ってことで、{$P$}に試して\nもらったんだけど……考えてみたら、強敵すぎたわね。", "zh": "为了付诸实践，就拿{$P$}试了试……\n但仔细一想，对手也太强劲了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8b79d2456da8456334c8144ec12902b4e062ff21767b62868d2be1d86405fc49", "ja": "なるほど、セクシーを……。\nけど、どうしてまた急に？", "zh": "原来是性感路线啊……\n不过，怎么又突然这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "eba8eb122ed0132e851469d1157adc68348b374e03c47f0a51b08eef17abe103", "ja": "それ！　聞いてよ、兄ちゃん！\nこれには、深～いワケがあってさ……！", "zh": "就是这个！听我说，哥哥！\n这背后可是有着深～层的原因……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1013_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "ad1bac73583018ddaabc00c096ab3996d11e2ab5749691901d128a3ab7a3810e", "ja": "おっ、いたいた！　おーいみんな、\nそろそろレッスンの時間だろ？　一緒に行こうぜ♪", "zh": "哦，找到了找到了！喂——大家，\n差不多该去上课了吧？一起走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "cdb91d033c923333b4e125410e409980d332a3bcc57e7564e9ab1436d9f14e63", "ja": "あ、スバル、ミライ！\nふたりも、コノミにセクシーを教わるノ？", "zh": "啊，昴、未来！\n你们两个也要向好美学习性感吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "c94bf8998792210f2f3c1230c345d249c335712af7ab9aae61ce90dfe45ca098", "ja": "えっ、セクシー？　{$P$}さん、\nそれって、次の公演に関係あるんですか？", "zh": "诶，性感？　{$P$}先生，这和下一场公演有关吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5bc2278ae5b31b76d352501e6ef33ca7bc535baa8ebbc9224aaae1157019a186", "ja": "いや、公演には関係ないかな。", "zh": "不，跟演出倒是没什么关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "8b18eae5261011d07b34581a602e6bb8f2d68e40d94307440cf4e21685d13b1e", "ja": "ワタシは、マミがやってて面白そうだったから、\n一緒に教えてもらってただけだヨ～。", "zh": "我只是觉得真美做起来好像很有意思，所以跟她一起请教来着～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "f3bb527faf353f58ec0558e14f78ffbeaa47c5e229ff96f9d4a63861bf4b41bb", "ja": "そう、真美がこのみんにお願いしたんだ。\n実は……。", "zh": "对，是我拜托好美教我的。\n其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "32b7061474288e66fc71e494e632a9a97369884a643873bf084a61b11597772b", "ja": "最近、真美じゃなくて亜美が、\n大人っぽくなったって言われるんだよ～！！", "zh": "最近啊，大家都说亚美比真美更有大人味了啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "a4c8cfe9ae87d01075d454241c105d8b55dc49720e960d4a78d54139200d9bbe", "ja": "クラスの男子とかも、\n「亜美、最近なんか可愛くね？」とか言ってて……。", "zh": "就连班上的男生也会说：\n“亚美最近是不是变可爱了？”\n……之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1022_p", "source_sha256": "8c947e29f291ca934c6746b25098d527bdad2cfe142f5d18f5b41e2a88167920", "ja": "思ったより微妙な理由だったな……\nけど、そうか。亜美が……。", "zh": "理由比想象中还微妙啊……\n不过，这样啊。亚美她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "06e5525155bea938ec3c7f9e7e58716447d31ae34c2a2736177f0605f6c3e6c2", "ja": "オレ、ちょっとわかるなー。最近、亜美を見てて\n「大人っぽく見えるかも」って思ったことあるもん。", "zh": "我也有点明白了。最近看着亜美的时候，\n我也曾觉得“她看起来可能更像大人了”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "e7215c6d34425d73b8aced62dec7ce81643594cfb82f0978d753ff02f9016e7e", "ja": "昴くんまで～！？\n真美のアイデンティティが……ガク……。", "zh": "连昴君也这样说——！？\n真美的身份认同……崩塌了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "f1285ab6abfc441c81c23ef0016598ff1ee9cd1cd694d59cb80efe73b6e544b7", "ja": "中学生って、成長期だものね。\n亜美ちゃんも、大人の階段を登っているのね……。", "zh": "毕竟初中生正处于成长期嘛。\n亚美也在一步步长大成人呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "e744ba88fc284a91b88b70be7da88fc8be0b20fca5fc5a2a6ca3a1cc2f8774cd", "ja": "でも、亜美がセクシーになったなら、真美だって\nセクシーになってるんじゃないの？　双子なんだし！", "zh": "不过，既然亚美变得性感了，真美不也变得性感了吗？毕竟是双胞胎嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1027_012mam", "source_sha256": "b13b9f0f901d22b6afa591aa85de60eabf4409c3de72f220a5f65c881dee1eeb", "ja": "同じくらいじゃダメなんだよ、みらいっち！\nセクシーと言えば、亜美じゃなくて真美っしょ！？", "zh": "光是差不多可不行啊，未来亲！\n说到性感，怎么想都该是真美而不是亚美吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "30b74bccc299fbec1fd3c9af3e2690c927fb790862a81419c6269cc96cc574b6", "ja": "これは、絶対に負けられない戦いなのだよ……！", "zh": "这可是绝对不能输的战斗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1029_012mam", "source_sha256": "ea8cd242f8c710dba6e8ef30d16f3365bb08b7cadb4613ec016797d51387cb7d", "ja": "だからここは、セクシーを磨いて亜美と勝負なんだよ！\nこのみん！　引き続き、よろしく頼んだ～！", "zh": "所以，这里就要磨炼性感魅力，和亚美一决胜负啦！\n小木实！接下来也拜托你啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "369e67f581d12098824290cb21328d581e6f71bf5edf99d5b54ff19e80509f78", "ja": "それは構わないけど……でも、相手は亜美ちゃんよね。\n何を教えればいいのかしら……むむむ。", "zh": "那倒没关系……不过，对手是亚美吧。\n该教些什么才好呢……唔唔唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1031_p", "source_sha256": "da0478952d27d285f846bfcd592954f356eee84442e067fe96c2d4083d0ea0c0", "ja": "真美。セクシーもいいけど、\nそろそろ次の定期公演の準備をしないとだぞ。", "zh": "真美。性感路线是不错，但也该差不多准备下一次定期公演了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1032_012mam", "source_sha256": "58fc974b992cc5dcabbda1cc6455f65aedfb92bdae411625d0e8f3bbe45e9b37", "ja": "そこは完璧だよ、兄ちゃん！\n真美の新曲、ラブソングでしょ？", "zh": "那里可是完美无缺哦，哥哥！\n真美的新歌是情歌，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "9df7a7a48dcc9bd604f77d4d18910afd6584866d3fb1516eeb7842199cfa6c59", "ja": "ラブといえばセクシーが付きものだかんね♪\n一石二鳥ってやつだよ！", "zh": "说到爱，就少不了性感嘛♪\n这就叫一举两得！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1034_p", "source_sha256": "4068c97b8fdb8bcf09c0e7d5fb48dc2c7210de7fb77d276e766b7c189fb37cb9", "ja": "ラブにセクシーは付きもの……そうだろうか。\nまぁ、確かに恋愛の歌ではあるけど。", "zh": "说到爱就少不了性感……真的是这样吗？不过，确实是首恋爱歌曲就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1035_p", "source_sha256": "c645c4acc0bce41019df4915f13045bf84029641967128084a8189a1c8d3ee94", "ja": "セクシー特訓もいいけど、\nレッスンに支障が出ないように、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "性感特训也不错，不过要注意别影响训练，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1036_012mam", "source_sha256": "f1925f0d216338e51fa923812ae349093c97febc8f277a3e5449ab2479abf646", "ja": "ラジャーだよ、兄ちゃん！\n見てなよ……今始まる、真美のセクシー伝説を！", "zh": "收到啦，哥哥！\n看好了……真美的性感传说，现在就要开始了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_108_1037_p", "source_sha256": "e98fe7de1de899b50dc71ce83fb09ab52ef58d6248f7ddc08660f75da78ab1ad", "ja": "（まあ、しばらく様子を見てみるか。ある意味、\nやる気はあるみたいだし……水は差したくないからな）", "zh": "（不过，先观察一阵子吧。她看起来也算是干劲十足……\n我可不想泼她冷水。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
